        <mxCell id="db-model-notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Keys and constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK: primary key. FK: foreign key. UK: unique parent-scoped request key.&lt;br&gt;STRICT tables. All columns required except the two NULL defaults.&lt;br&gt;FK changes/deletes: RESTRICT. Names: nonblank. Timestamps: UTC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conditional uniqueness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bookings(trial_class_id, student_id) where status = confirmed.&lt;br&gt;payment_attempts(booking_id) where outcome = succeeded.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;State guards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insert pending; allow only pending-to-terminal changes. Enforce the documented state/reason combinations. Terminal booking state requires its matching payment result; confirmation also requires fewer than four other confirmed bookings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IDs, FKs, request keys, requested outcomes and creation times stay fixed. Finalized attempts cannot change or be deleted.&lt;br&gt;The roster comes from confirmed bookings." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="8" y="1430" width="574" height="385" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
